# Changelog

## 0.27.19 — 2026-11-09

- Provide a declarative Claude Directory release for community organization rules.
- Retain 45 advertising, analytics, SEO, content, WordPress, and CRM skills.
- Use OAuth connectors and public or supplied evidence for SEO, link checks, and
  content planning; disclose coverage limits and require approval before writes.
- Exclude local programs and helper-dependent skills from this distribution.
- Restrict skill frontmatter to descriptive name and description fields.
